2. 3D Anatomical Heart Model (web/public/models/heart.glb)
================================================================================
This work incorporates and modifies 3D anatomical models from BodyParts3D:
BodyParts3D, © The Database Center for Life Science (DBCLS), Japan.
Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 2.1 Japan (CC BY-SA 2.1 JP).
URL: https://lifesciencedb.jp/bp3d/

The derived asset `web/public/models/heart.glb` was constructed
via `scripts/build_heart_glb.py` by extracting
anatomical artery branches (LAD, LCX, RCA), the ascending aorta, and performing 70% quadric
decimation on myocardial chamber walls to meet real-time rendering budgets (83,600 triangles).

Pursuant to the ShareAlike condition of CC BY-SA 2.1 Japan, `web/public/models/heart.glb`
and any derivative coronary artery 3D meshes are released and distributed under the
identical Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 2.1 Japan (CC BY-SA 2.1 JP) license.

