3. Clinical Dataset
================================================================================
Dataset: UCI Extension of Z-Alizadeh Sani CAD Dataset (UCI Dataset ID: 411).
Origin: Shaheed Rajaei Cardiovascular, Medical and Research Center, Tehran, Iran (303 patients referred for coronary angiography).
Citation: Alizadehsani, R., Roshanzamir, M., & Sani, Z. (2017).
"extention of Z-Alizadeh sani dataset [Dataset]". UCI Machine Learning Repository / Mendeley Data.
